    <subfield code="a">On the outside of the book is a separate illustration of a pair of wings attached at the spine over the cover. At the center of the book is an illustration of a cockroach, with additional legs and feelers attached to the fore edge and top of the pages, respectively. The book has the appearance of a cockroach if it is opened at the center and stood on its fore edges.</subfield>
